    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40781" root="نيت" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاتَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنِيتُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَيْتٌ</span>; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاتَ</span>,
aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنُوتُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوْتٌ</span>; (L, K;) <i>He</i> (a man)
<i>moved from side to side in walking</i> (L, art
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نوت</span>:) or <i>he so moved by reason of weakness,</i>
or <i>infirmity:</i> (K:) or, <i>by reason of drowsiness.</i>
(L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نوت</span>, q. v.)

